WEBVTT

00:00:04.570 --> 00:00:05.630
We’re not going to make it!

00:00:05.630 --> 00:00:06.940
We’re late! We’re late!

00:00:07.580 --> 00:00:09.290
Hurry, Ichigo!

00:00:09.790 --> 00:00:10.900
Stop for a moment!

00:00:11.660 --> 00:00:13.860
Wait for me, you two!

00:00:13.860 --> 00:00:16.200
What are you saying? Dash for it!

00:00:18.750 --> 00:00:20.620
Wait for me!

00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:27.540
Ichigo, look out!!

00:00:33.520 --> 00:00:35.940
Ahh, that was close…

00:00:35.940 --> 00:00:39.150
Ichigo, recently you seem to do
impossible stuff from time to time.

00:00:39.150 --> 00:00:41.810
It’s like you’re superhuman
or something.

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:44.820
That’s true…

00:00:44.820 --> 00:00:46.770
Forget about that, the gate is closing!

00:00:49.700 --> 00:00:51.780
Did everyone see that!?

00:00:51.780 --> 00:00:56.290
That girl goes to our school too, Captain?

00:00:56.290 --> 00:00:59.300
Yes, we can’t just ignore that.

00:00:59.300 --> 00:01:02.760
No matter what, we have to get it!

00:01:12.970 --> 00:01:15.680
Are you Momimiya Ichigo-san?

00:01:17.690 --> 00:01:19.730
Yes and…

00:01:19.730 --> 00:01:23.100
Momomiya-san, do you have any interest in Rhythmic Gymnastics?

00:01:24.200 --> 00:01:25.530
Rhythmic gymnastics?

00:01:25.530 --> 00:01:27.350
What’s this about?

00:01:27.350 --> 00:01:30.910
We’re the Daikan Junior Highschool’s rhythmic gymnastics team.

00:01:30.910 --> 00:01:36.420
We could really use your talent, that’s what we came here to ask.

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:41.210
And… are you asking me to do rhythmic gymnastics?

00:01:41.210 --> 00:01:42.290
Yes!

00:01:42.290 --> 00:01:44.340
WHAT!??

00:01:44.340 --> 00:01:45.250
Please!!!

00:01:45.250 --> 00:01:48.930
Our club just started this year but…

00:01:48.930 --> 00:01:53.590
…with our current members, we need one more to enter the competition

00:01:54.350 --> 00:02:00.020
…and if we can’t enter the match, then we’ll be forced to drop out!

00:02:00.020 --> 00:02:03.350
But I… haven’t even tried rhythmic gymnastics or any sport.

00:02:03.350 --> 00:02:04.570
And after school…

00:02:04.570 --> 00:02:05.580
Momomiya-san!

00:02:06.570 --> 00:02:08.660
We saw it…

00:02:08.660 --> 00:02:10.440
…your revolutionary high jump.

00:02:14.160 --> 00:02:16.240
Uh that’s… that was a mistake.

00:02:17.540 --> 00:02:19.420
They saw what happened!

00:02:19.420 --> 00:02:20.440
Isn’t that good?

00:02:20.440 --> 00:02:23.840
If you’re in rhythmic gymnastics then you’d be closer to Aoyama-kun.

00:02:23.840 --> 00:02:29.180
Yeah, you might even become a star with your superhuman reflexes.

00:02:29.180 --> 00:02:32.170
You two, thinking for me.

00:02:32.170 --> 00:02:35.880
Sorry, but I’m kind of busy…

00:02:36.270 --> 00:02:38.440
Oh, that’s too bad.

00:02:39.770 --> 00:02:41.220
Do it till the end!

00:02:42.680 --> 00:02:43.680
Yes!

00:02:48.050 --> 00:02:49.400
What’re you doing?

00:02:50.950 --> 00:02:52.870
It’s finished.

00:02:52.870 --> 00:02:55.670
Oh how cute… look, Momomiya-san!

00:02:58.870 --> 00:03:00.550
This is… me?

00:03:01.750 --> 00:03:06.800
It’s so cute! I always wanted to try on a leotard.

00:03:06.800 --> 00:03:08.760
Does that mean you’ll accept?

00:03:08.760 --> 00:03:12.670
Yes! Momomiya Ichigo will do Rhythmic gymnastics!

00:03:17.480 --> 00:03:19.380
Performance demonstration, start!

00:03:31.110 --> 00:03:34.080
Wow… this is Rhythmic Gymnastics?

00:03:42.210 --> 00:03:43.110
W-Whaat…

00:03:43.110 --> 00:03:44.320
Nya~!??

00:03:44.840 --> 00:03:47.330
I can’t stand it!!

00:04:00.850 --> 00:04:02.680
I haven’t seen anything like that!

00:04:07.020 --> 00:04:07.970
Nya nya?

00:04:14.820 --> 00:04:16.860
Momomiya-san, that was so great!

00:04:17.910 --> 00:04:20.290
It wasn’t rhythmic gymnastics but…

00:04:20.290 --> 00:04:23.960
that was the first time I’ve seen the ball and ribbon used that way.

00:04:23.960 --> 00:04:24.570
Yoshi!

00:04:25.080 --> 00:04:28.650
We’ll definitely enter this tournament!

00:04:28.650 --> 00:04:29.530
Yeah!!!

00:04:33.360 --> 00:04:36.730
One-two, one-two…

00:04:37.970 --> 00:04:40.220
I can’t, it’s as far as I can go.

00:04:40.220 --> 00:04:41.560
We can’t stop here.

00:04:41.560 --> 00:04:46.450
Momomiya-san, this is for your future as a gymnast!

00:04:48.870 --> 00:04:52.240
Fighto, fighto, fighto, fighto, fighto…

00:04:58.090 --> 00:05:00.620
Momomiya-san,
put those feet forward!

00:05:00.620 --> 00:05:01.960
Huh? Ok…

00:05:02.790 --> 00:05:05.570
Not that way, straighten up more.

00:05:05.570 --> 00:05:06.530
Yess…

00:05:07.020 --> 00:05:08.000
Do your best!

00:05:08.000 --> 00:05:11.500
After this is done, we’ll start with the real training.

00:05:11.920 --> 00:05:13.180
Ok…

00:05:18.300 --> 00:05:20.270
A-aah Ichigo is…

00:05:19.600 --> 00:05:21.000
…doing Rhythmic gymnastics?!

00:05:21.770 --> 00:05:23.730
Isn’t that great?

00:05:23.730 --> 00:05:25.530
The theme of Rhythmic gymnastics,

00:05:25.530 --> 00:05:28.970
is the expression of female beauty and grace by the whole body.

00:05:28.970 --> 00:05:32.360
For example, the ball bouncing like being in love,

00:05:32.360 --> 00:05:34.900
…and the ribbon whirling in a spiral.

00:05:34.900 --> 00:05:35.940
It’s wonderful!

00:05:36.280 --> 00:05:42.370
But it’s hard, if only I’m free to use the power of Mew Strawberry…

00:05:42.370 --> 00:05:45.950
The power of Mew Strawberry?

00:05:45.950 --> 00:05:46.870
Yep.

00:05:46.870 --> 00:05:51.590
Because if I don’t transform,
I can’t use it.

00:05:52.050 --> 00:05:56.340
In that case, you just have to use your own power.

00:05:56.340 --> 00:05:59.220
But there’s little time
until the tournament.

00:05:59.220 --> 00:06:02.800
I wonder if there’s a way
to use it freely.

00:06:03.470 --> 00:06:04.760
Hrmm, I wonder…

00:06:05.560 --> 00:06:07.260
Maybe Shirogane knows.

00:06:07.650 --> 00:06:10.400
Yeah, he’s on the second floor.

00:06:10.400 --> 00:06:12.150
…but right now, probably…

00:06:12.150 --> 00:06:14.140
Then I’ll go see Shirogane.

00:06:16.300 --> 00:06:17.560
Shirogane?

00:06:18.740 --> 00:06:19.960
Shirogane!

00:06:22.410 --> 00:06:25.030
Hey, answer me.

00:06:32.960 --> 00:06:36.790
W-What… How come he looks like that?

00:06:38.510 --> 00:06:39.640
A bed…

00:06:40.140 --> 00:06:41.940
and a computer only…?

00:06:42.390 --> 00:06:44.960
It seems kind of lonely.

00:06:45.560 --> 00:06:50.560
And yeah, how come he lives in a place like this?

00:06:50.560 --> 00:06:53.430
He’s a high school student but he runs this place.

00:06:53.990 --> 00:06:57.600
And how come he knows
about aliens?

00:06:58.450 --> 00:07:02.000
And he’s always… with me.

00:07:07.200 --> 00:07:09.280
What’re you doing peeping at me!!?

00:07:11.430 --> 00:07:13.970
Well hurry up and put on some clothes!

00:07:15.590 --> 00:07:17.130
What do you want?

00:07:17.130 --> 00:07:19.090
No, nothing!!

00:07:21.340 --> 00:07:25.810
It was a complete mistake thinking of asking Shirogane.

00:07:27.450 --> 00:07:32.610
It’s no use, I guess I won’t be able to use Mew Strawberry’s powers.

00:07:32.610 --> 00:07:35.400
I’ll have to quit rhythmic gymnastics.

00:07:35.400 --> 00:07:37.440
I’ll go and tell them tomorrow…

00:07:37.440 --> 00:07:39.810
Ichigo, Aoyama! Aoyama!

00:07:43.320 --> 00:07:44.940
Ah, Momomiya-san!

00:07:52.880 --> 00:07:54.670
Aoyama-kun!

00:07:54.670 --> 00:07:57.000
Still practicing this late?

00:07:57.000 --> 00:07:59.840
There’s a meet coming up.

00:07:59.840 --> 00:08:02.580
I heard you entered
Rhythmic gymnastics.

00:08:06.060 --> 00:08:07.850
I see.

00:08:07.850 --> 00:08:10.010
Then I’ll come and cheer for you.

00:08:10.010 --> 00:08:11.440
Ehh?

00:08:11.440 --> 00:08:13.280
See you, good luck!

00:08:17.360 --> 00:08:19.320
Aoyama-kun…

00:08:19.320 --> 00:08:21.330
…is going to cheer for me?

00:08:21.950 --> 00:08:23.690
YES!!!

00:08:25.440 --> 00:08:27.960
Starting tomorrow I have to do my best, Nya~!

00:08:38.180 --> 00:08:40.640
One, two, one…

00:08:40.640 --> 00:08:43.270
Ah Momomiya-san, you’re early today.

00:08:43.270 --> 00:08:44.180
Yes.

00:08:44.180 --> 00:08:46.940
I’ve to try harder to catch up with everyone.

00:08:46.940 --> 00:08:49.290
My, you’re finally taking this seriously.

00:08:49.290 --> 00:08:50.690
Naturally!

00:08:50.690 --> 00:08:53.380
So everyone, let’s go for our run!

00:08:55.860 --> 00:09:00.330
Fighto, fighto, fighto, fighto…

00:09:00.330 --> 00:09:03.450
Fighto! What’s wrong, everyone? Try harder!

00:09:03.450 --> 00:09:05.080
Everyone, do your best!

00:09:05.080 --> 00:09:07.980
With Momomiya-san we’re sure to win the tournament!

00:09:14.370 --> 00:09:16.880
What graceful movements!

00:09:16.880 --> 00:09:19.330
It’s like seeing someone so great…

00:09:27.810 --> 00:09:30.230
Again with that.

00:09:30.230 --> 00:09:33.920
No one can do that wild dynamic performance but her.

00:09:43.330 --> 00:09:44.930
Momomiya-san, are you alright?

00:09:44.930 --> 00:09:45.950
Are you hurt?

00:09:45.950 --> 00:09:49.940
I’m ok, I think I overdid it.

00:09:50.540 --> 00:09:51.970
Thank goodness.

00:09:52.800 --> 00:09:55.900
Momomiya-san, I’m really glad
we asked you to join.

00:09:55.900 --> 00:09:57.760
But…

00:09:57.760 --> 00:09:59.870
The actual part starts now!

00:10:00.510 --> 00:10:03.770
Finally, the match is this Sunday!

00:10:07.850 --> 00:10:09.920
Wuahh! This much people came!

00:10:11.110 --> 00:10:13.550
I’m kind of nervous…

00:10:13.550 --> 00:10:15.670
I wonder if Aoyama-kun is coming?

00:10:15.190 --> 00:10:15.670
Ichigo!

00:10:17.150 --> 00:10:18.860
Ichigo-san, this is the day.

00:10:18.860 --> 00:10:20.740
You guys came!

00:10:20.740 --> 00:10:23.040
Yo! You’re doing Rhythmic gymnastics?

00:10:24.410 --> 00:10:26.480
Sounds interesting! Good luck.

00:10:28.250 --> 00:10:29.940
Thank you everyone.

00:10:31.670 --> 00:10:35.890
<i>Next up is Momomiya Ichigo from Daikan Junior High.</i>

00:10:40.220 --> 00:10:41.930
Go! Ichigo!

00:10:41.930 --> 00:10:44.580
Good luck! We’ll be cheering for you!

00:10:47.770 --> 00:10:49.670
Eh, Aoyama-kun…

00:10:50.890 --> 00:10:52.770
Where’s Aoyama-kun?

00:10:52.770 --> 00:10:54.380
He’s not here?

00:10:55.150 --> 00:10:57.380
<i>I’ll definitely go and cheer you on the tournament.</i>

00:10:59.070 --> 00:11:00.950
Begin performance!

00:11:07.750 --> 00:11:08.730
I can’t move…

00:11:09.620 --> 00:11:11.460
My nervousness isn’t going away…

00:11:11.460 --> 00:11:13.670
Good luck Momomiya-san!

00:11:13.670 --> 00:11:15.730
It all depends on your performance!

00:11:16.670 --> 00:11:19.140
…The future of rhythmic gymnastics!

00:11:21.550 --> 00:11:24.910
Momomiya-san, don’t worry! Do it like always!

00:11:26.220 --> 00:11:27.420
What’s wrong, Ichigo?

00:11:27.420 --> 00:11:28.410
Get a hold of yourself!

00:11:31.020 --> 00:11:32.830
Good luck, Momomiya-san!

00:11:33.190 --> 00:11:36.170
You practiced this, right?
Have confidence!

00:11:40.990 --> 00:11:42.840
I can’t move!

00:11:43.450 --> 00:11:45.410
It’s no use…

00:12:03.220 --> 00:12:04.990
Sorry I’m late!

00:12:06.430 --> 00:12:08.040
Aoyama-kun!?

00:12:09.600 --> 00:12:12.000
Do your best! Momomiya-san!

00:12:13.100 --> 00:12:14.170
YES!

00:13:00.570 --> 00:13:02.190
Hrmp, boring…

00:13:02.190 --> 00:13:04.660
Why don’t we spice this up?

00:13:18.880 --> 00:13:21.360
Danger! Ichigo, danger!

00:13:21.360 --> 00:13:22.690
What?

00:13:22.170 --> 00:13:23.490
Ichigo, watch out!

00:13:36.720 --> 00:13:38.330
There’s a fire!

00:13:39.650 --> 00:13:41.280
Let’s go out!

00:13:43.230 --> 00:13:44.010
Ichigo!

00:13:44.740 --> 00:13:45.800
Shirogane!

00:13:51.450 --> 00:13:54.020
Momomiya-san, Momomiya-san. Where are you?

00:14:01.670 --> 00:14:03.570
Quiche! It’s you again.

00:14:04.300 --> 00:14:06.030
Hi… Ichigo!

00:14:06.030 --> 00:14:10.270
I have a present for your cute practice!

00:14:16.020 --> 00:14:17.210
What is this?

00:14:17.940 --> 00:14:20.350
You can see it’s a Chimera Anima!

00:14:20.350 --> 00:14:21.560
It’s coming!

00:14:21.560 --> 00:14:22.670
No choice have we?

00:14:24.070 --> 00:14:28.450
Mew Mew Mint METAMORPHO-SE!

00:14:58.580 --> 00:15:02.710
Mew Mew Lettuce METAMORPHO-SE!

00:15:27.950 --> 00:15:32.270
Mew Mew Strawberry METAMORPHO-SE!

00:16:10.800 --> 00:16:12.260
For the future of the Earth…

00:16:12.260 --> 00:16:13.570
At your service! ~Nya!

00:16:40.620 --> 00:16:41.720
Mew Strawberry!

00:16:43.830 --> 00:16:45.050
Why you…!

00:16:47.330 --> 00:16:48.480
Mew Mint!

00:16:51.050 --> 00:16:52.780
Stop it!

00:16:58.930 --> 00:17:02.450
We’ll show you a top rhythmic gymnastic performance!

00:17:07.400 --> 00:17:09.050
Minto! Retasu! Now!

00:17:09.730 --> 00:17:12.120
MintonArrow!!

00:17:18.280 --> 00:17:22.520
Reborn… Mint ECHO!!

00:17:24.710 --> 00:17:26.710
LettasTanets!

00:17:34.800 --> 00:17:39.780
Reborn… Lettuce RUSH!

00:17:42.830 --> 00:17:43.700
StrawberBell!

00:18:03.290 --> 00:18:06.850
Reborn Strawberry… CHECK!!

00:18:21.220 --> 00:18:22.490
Retrieve!

00:18:35.320 --> 00:18:38.840
<i>The winner of this match is Hongo Junior High School,</i>

00:18:38.840 --> 00:18:44.810
<i>and special mention for a wonderful performance by Daikan Junior High School.</i>

00:18:45.330 --> 00:18:49.540
Ichigo made a lot of misses,
didn’t she?

00:18:49.540 --> 00:18:52.760
It can’t be helped, she performed after fighting.

00:18:55.460 --> 00:18:59.610
Captain, I’m sorry,
if I didn’t miss so much...

00:18:59.610 --> 00:19:03.930
No, because of you we performed as hard as we could.

00:19:03.930 --> 00:19:05.080
It was really a lot of fun.

00:19:05.680 --> 00:19:07.350
Yeah, it was very!

00:19:07.350 --> 00:19:10.520
Momomiya-san you’re our MVP!

00:19:10.520 --> 00:19:12.580
No way… but really?!

00:19:24.270 --> 00:19:25.350
It was pretty busy there.

00:19:26.160 --> 00:19:29.930
I was wondering what’s going to happen but I’m glad everything’s ok.

00:19:30.410 --> 00:19:32.510
Thank you, Aoyama-kun.

00:19:34.540 --> 00:19:36.380
Aoyama-kun…

00:19:36.380 --> 00:19:42.020
Even just knowing that you’re watching me warms my heart.

00:19:43.740 --> 00:19:47.270
Always… always… just like this.

00:19:55.860 --> 00:19:58.910
Eh… Where did you come from?

00:19:59.400 --> 00:20:00.550
You’re cute.

00:20:01.110 --> 00:20:03.550
Ehh!?! You’re still here?

00:20:04.840 --> 00:20:06.710
Hey wait… Stop it!

00:20:07.390 --> 00:20:09.410
Stop it…

00:20:09.410 --> 00:20:11.710
You stink like fish.

00:20:11.710 --> 00:20:12.890
You know him?

00:20:14.580 --> 00:20:16.860
Looks like he likes you.

00:20:18.840 --> 00:20:22.260
Oh and when we were getting to the good part!

00:20:22.260 --> 00:20:24.310
Stop it..!

00:20:25.080 --> 00:20:29.120
Shirogane… is holding a party for me?

00:20:29.120 --> 00:20:30.530
Isn’t it a bit old-fashioned?

00:20:30.530 --> 00:20:32.670
Ichigo… you’re going to be absent?

00:20:32.670 --> 00:20:35.040
Shirogane! I was kidding, I was kidding!

00:20:35.040 --> 00:20:36.870
Then you won’t need this dress?

00:20:36.870 --> 00:20:40.880
It’s so cute… Could Shirogane be doing this for me?

00:20:40.880 --> 00:20:42.590
Thank you!

00:20:42.590 --> 00:20:45.100
Wait a moment, with you being this nice to me,

00:20:45.100 --> 00:20:47.260
there must be something up your sleeve.

00:20:47.260 --> 00:20:49.100
Next! Piano of the Heart.

00:20:49.100 --> 00:20:50.770
A Throbbing Ball ~Nya!

00:20:50.770 --> 00:20:53.780
For the Earth’s future,
we’ll be of service ~nya!
